751.jpeg/g1xWkjqGczIOnpQz3RvbknRRpMqRaVBIaw8DxGsPA8Q\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803725306531840456732.jpeg/zzR4SbCcqpazg1dbf_XYNVEAv9mkgxYrvxHV1r8R1dY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803720797130752543820.jpeg/gR_9lYslyFwZpd-IptLtUGv8_4rkLkBKNLcmejS3Jno\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803723661971456984726.jpeg/ohP2-ivbVEzYs2kHw7JFxvBXTk4NzfqqjWkOI41pDiM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803726786859008596384.jpeg/8m7AoNEy8gFh4wtHJmcIAtFuClMwBZ-A-uaOHvrmjh4\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803730889019392286547.jpeg/hFhbn7aexuFtyl3oW3OBecIms1_wF4d7wUnN6MFJzeg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803734387200000025943.jpeg/RZkx29XgUagPI4sp3IBayjWqyuoFaWIMClT5xApU-cQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803722323857408031965.jpeg/fmjwuHdfR0DnmqPbPZsy8BCcT8SAwkQ9ExvffBMb33w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803725482299392569038.jpeg/9Kjb8WRsMzBXHdhX0X4UVAcC1qVTqQmtl_RnR5f0Z0c\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803728871428096617053.jpeg/zjAaSBUYkN59e1UWPea-DKJKgv6MebTjML4aYjC-GmI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803732197642240548261.jpeg/7tZvArC8sLASjHKVo1h-VfVNomO-QFHGHO7PJRzuzyU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803735163146240583617.jpeg/Tex4yApRpRWbtsiDacoM1oMo65cLpPwtvEedurxHnbo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803681337118720703489.jpeg/VrCJtdkKO70gA2vDHtchCaKCrlNg9H4YGWoL0BlqC9A\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803684571058176308951.jpeg/xCKUxw5LgMXGt8Y8SHncGqZdlzA9Ub8mWaGtG1mhrRs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187803688127959040451092.jpeg/lbgTb_AcbcQb9tFivpGQl1MnpgEGSC9Y8kn-D_JJ_g8\"/><figure><img alt=\"陳美寶指，政府未來會委託本港培訓機構進行線上課程，以便利外國客。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187802434638974976475361.jpeg/L25oGdH3FH2zOeI_1DO_Dk6EdTKXtumWXjX84HQ1_OA\"/><figcaption>陳美寶指，政府未來會委託本港培訓機構進行線上課程，以便利外國客。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><p>陳美寶：將推線上課程　便利外國客</p><p>政府其後舉辦歡迎儀式，運輸及物流局局長陳美寶指，有船東在港預訂酒店，將留港三、四日，體現粵艇南下帶來的高端消費力。她表示，目前有53宗已完成的粵艇南下申請。她亦指，海事處現時在內地有七個培訓中心，未來會委託本港培訓機構進行線上課程，以便利外國客。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:00:02.623697+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1519,"images":37,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T08:46:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:37:43.626313+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:57:51.023749+00:00","content_hash":"5ab3b179a1c39d6959c61e534a3f5a83d452b580b6182580579172af0d4f8eae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}